  "_comment": "Share-card (og:image) mapping. Read by src/lib/seo.ts at runtime and by the prerender scripts through scripts/lib/og-images.cjs, so the card a scraper fetches matches the one set after hydration. Files live in public/assets/. The category images are designer artwork, dropped in by hand as 1200x630 JPGs under 300 KB; default, order and conditions are still generated by scripts/generate-og-images.cjs. Every image shows the category name only, never a product name (RA 9711). Bump categoryVersion whenever a category file is replaced under the same name: it goes on the URL as ?v=, and without a new URL Facebook keeps serving the picture it cached.",
